# Paths removed from the PUBLIC snapshot (github.com/evymo/aisha-orchestrator).
# The upstream tree is never modified by this list — only the published tree is.
# One gitignore-style pattern per line; put the reason in the comment above it.
# Consumed by scripts/release/public-snapshot.mjs (see docs/release/PUBLIC_PREVIEW.md).

# Dependabot never ran on the primary forge (dependency updates: scripts/aisha-deps-update.mjs).
# On the public mirror it only opened pull requests nobody merged (66 branches by 2026-09) and
# the gate `owasp-orchestrator-adoption` still expects the file upstream, so it stays there.
.github/dependabot.yml

# Owner's decision 2026-10-03: nothing runs on GitHub — no tests, no deploys, no signing. CI and
# deployment live on the upstream forge (.forgejo/workflows/). The mirror workflows stay upstream,
# where four gates read them (ci-deploy-honesty, no-hardcoded-coolify-uuids, owasp-orchestrator-adoption,
# sbom-coverage); in a public clone those four gates therefore report the files as missing.
.github/workflows/
